        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You’re an ordinary tourist on a relaxing vacation to Emerald Valley.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But shortly after arriving, the tour guide brings troubling news — a sudden landslide has sealed off the only road out.<br>No one can leave. At least… not for now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soon, you realize this may be more than just an accident.<br>Strange noises in the distance, scattered notes that don’t quite add up, eerie stone formations — the valley feels like an invisible maze waiting to be unraveled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a point-and-click puzzle game, in this game, you will:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔑Explore environments by clicking through each scene<br>🔑Collect and organize clues<br>🔑Share information with other stranded tourists</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔑 Use the correct items to interact with tourists and gather more information. First, &quot;click the item&quot; to select it, then         &quot;click the target&quot; to deliver it. (If there is no response, it usually means the selected item does not match the target.)  <br>🔑 Travel between different locations to investigate further</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together fragments of memory, logic, and observation to uncover the real reason no one can leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the truth — and lead your companions out of the valley.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If leaving is still possible…</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You’re an ordinary tourist on a relaxing vacation to Emerald Valley.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But shortly after arriving, the tour guide brings troubling news — a sudden landslide has sealed off the only road out.<br>No one can leave. At least… not for now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soon, you realize this may be more than just an accident.<br>Strange noises in the distance, scattered notes that don’t quite add up, eerie stone formations — the valley feels like an invisible maze waiting to be unraveled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a point-and-click puzzle game, in this game, you will:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔑Explore environments by clicking through each scene<br>🔑Collect and organize clues<br>🔑Share information with other stranded tourists</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔑 Use the correct items to interact with tourists and gather more information. First, &quot;click the item&quot; to select it, then         &quot;click the target&quot; to deliver it. (If there is no response, it usually means the selected item does not match the target.)  <br>🔑 Travel between different locations to investigate further</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together fragments of memory, logic, and observation to uncover the real reason no one can leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the truth — and lead your companions out of the valley.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If leaving is still possible…</strong></p>",
